Package: libcuddle0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: cuddle core library
 libcuddle holds version, datadir paths, the protocol catalog, themes,
 and optional XDG preferences. soversion 0: ABI is not frozen.
 Nothing is stored or sent.

Package: libcuddle-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libcuddle0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for libcuddle
 Headers and pkg-config for libcuddle. Plugin ABI is documented but
 the loader stays disabled until soversion 1.

Package: cuddle-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3
Description: arch-independent data for cuddle
 Bash engine, themes, TUI script, and the local Soft Signal HTML page
 installed under /usr/share/cuddle.

Package: cuddle
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libcuddle0 (= ${binary:Version}), cuddle-data (>= ${source:Version})
Recommends: cuddle-tui, cuddle-gui
Description: consent-first local companion (CLI)
 Local, file-less companion. Soft Signal (q) needs no explanation.
 The CLI dispatches to shared offline Litmo rooms and the bash engine.
 Not therapy. Not a product. Nothing is stored or sent.

Package: cuddle-tui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libcuddle0 (= ${binary:Version}), cuddle-data (>= ${source:Version})
Description: terminal frontend for cuddle
 Ncurses containment hub. q is Soft Signal. Touch Language is a map,
 never consent.

Package: cuddle-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libcuddle0 (= ${binary:Version}), cuddle-data (>= ${source:Version})
Description: offline Litmo room hub for cuddle
 GTK4 hub for flood, touch mapping, conflict practice, morning, spooning,
 parallel play and aftercare. Shared preferences and a free Soft Signal.
 No network, scoring, haptics, or saved room answers.
